I see you have been having some trouble making your payments.  In reviewing your file I wanted to see if we could get you set up on a more permanent modification try to reduce your payment for an extended period due to COVID19 and the effect it has been having on our economy. Is that something you would be interested in?   If so, what would be a manageable daily or weekly payment?


Thank you,

